--- Config contents ---
\* CI config for jetpack_raft_composition (.github/workflows/formal.yml): the
\* constants and invariants of jetpack_raft_small.cfg with MaxElections = 0,
\* under CiStateConstraint, which keeps the message bound (10) and lowers the
\* term bound to 1 and the log bound to 2 entries.
\*
\* Covers: the fast path of one command (N1-N20: FastCmd to every replica,
\* FastAck (FastNack is unreachable: no view change and no conflicting
\* command), the fast commit with a superquorum), the leader's proposal of it
\* at ack time or on the original path, its replication, commit, execution and
\* GC (N21-N25), with all the small config's invariants.
\* Prunes: elections, and with them the whole recovery (section 2) and the
\* client's view change (N6-N9); a second copy of the command in a log. The
\* recovery is exercised by the probes the same workflow runs
\* (jetpack_raft_probe_recovery_NoViewInstalled.cfg and
\* jetpack_raft_probe_ci_NoFastCommittedInRecovered.cfg) and checked
\* exhaustively by the nightly jetpack_raft_small.cfg run.
\*
\* Measured with 2 workers (TLC 2026.10.30.154139, Temurin 21, shared 64-core
\* server): about half a minute (29 s to 37 s over three runs), 221,205 states
\* generated, 31,702 distinct states, no violation; the committed
\* log/*_jetpack_raft_composition_jetpack_raft_ci.log is the transcript of
\* such a run.
